-page-1","line":24},{"title":"lifecycle event dashboards","target":"LifecycleEventsDashboard","line":34},{"title":"HR Service Delivery","target":"hr-service-delivery","line":40},{"title":"Activate Lifecycle Events","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/activate-enterprise-onboarding-and-transitions-scoped.md","line":56},{"title":"Building a lifecycle event","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/hr-lifecycle-event-configuration.md","line":73},{"title":"Configure a lifecycle event","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-hr-lifecycle-event-type.md","line":79},{"title":"Configure a lifecycle event activity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-hr-lifecycle-event-activity.md","line":80},{"title":"Configure a lifecycle event activity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/configure-hr-lifecycle-event-activity.md","line":83},{"title":"Create an HR case for a lifecycle event","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/create-hr-lifecycle-event-case.md","line":100},{"title":"Monitor the status of a lifecycle event case","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/lifecycle-events/t_BundleExContexts.md","line":101},{"title":"Lifecyle events for enterprise","target":"enterprise-onboarding-transitions-landing-page","line":108},{"title":"Lifecycle Events","target":"hr-lifecycle-events-landing-page-1","line":109},{"title":"Activ